{'symbol': 'K', 'date': '2022-10-28 12:18:00', 'title': 'KELLOGG COMPANY DECLARES REGULAR DIVIDEND OF $0.59 PER SHARE', 'text': 'BATTLE CREEK, MICH. , OCT. 28, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- KELLOGG COMPANY (NYSE: K) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A DIVIDEND OF $0.59 PER SHARE ON THE COMMON STOCK OF THE COMPANY, PAYABLE ON DECEMBER 15, 2022, TO SHAREOWNERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON DECEMBER 1, 2022.'}